hecker validates heading procedures and HTML invocations for the selected model, with Work Planner's installed adoption reserved for its final conversion task.\n\n## Changes\n\nThe declared-model checks cover the proposed Work Planner presentation while its live documents keep their selected model.\n\n### Declared Models\n\n- **Structure selection.**\n  Explicit file entries select entry layouts; typed options describe heading steps, preambles, field contracts and call verbs.\n- **Procedure contracts.**\n  Step sequences follow their parent procedure, and Inputs/Outputs resolve the owning artifact's field contracts.\n\n### Invocation Reading\n\n- **Literal command payload.**\n  One lexical reader owns Markdown fences and HTML invocations, preserving shell text and required bold argument links.\n- **Execution and interfaces.**\n  Invocations sit in their executing step, with GraphQL REST-gap evidence scoped there and Projects V2 checks preserved.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Shared checker suite and declared-model specimens | AC1 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w01-per-skill-style-model/validation.md#shared-checker-suite) |\n| T2 | Complete local Work Planner suite | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w01-per-skill-style-model/validation.md#work-planner-suite) |\n| T3 | Work Planner zero-finding check | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w01-per-skill-style-model/validation.md#work-planner-check) |\n| T4 | Installed file preservation and exact baseline finding comparison | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/workflow-server/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-05-1616-i17-e01-w01-per-skill-style-model/validation.md#installed-tree-regression) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Delivery Record